(
    title: "Surround",
    developer: Some("Alan Miller"),
    description: Some("Two blocks crawl around an enclosed arena, each leaving a solid wall behind it, and the space closes in as they go. Steer your opponent into a wall — theirs, yours or the arena\'s — to take a point, first to ten wins. Modes vary the speed and whether diagonals are allowed, and two Video Graffiti settings turn the field into a drawing board."),
